or you Functional Analyst - CRM UniSC Sunshine Coast Individual contributor, L7 $105,843 - $115,703 +17% super, Professional, Student Services, Technical Support Behind every great student experience is a network of systems, processes and people working together seamlessly. As our next Functional Analyst - CRM, you'll play a key role in improving the technology and business processes that help students connect, engage and succeed throughout their journey at UniSC. Technician  (Allied Health - Paramedicine) UniSC Sunshine Coast Academic Support Unit, Individual contributor, L5 $82,843 - $93,358 +17% super, Technical Support Provide technical support and expertise for Paramedicine practical and simulation classes, ensuring smooth delivery, quality learning, and successful student outcomes. Outlets and Operations Officer UniSC Sunshine Coast Campus Development and Services, Individual contributor, L6 $95,986 - $103,873 +17% super Join UniSC as an Outlets Operations Officer and lead the delivery of exceptional food and hospitality services across vibrant campus venues. Clinical Administration Assistant UniSC Sunshine Coast Academic Support Unit, Administration / Admin Support, Individual contributor, L4 $76,275 - $80,218 +17% super Support the delivery of high-quality client services and efficient clinic operations across UniSC's Student-Led Clinics, helping create a professional, welcoming and well-organised environment. Join our talent community! Sign up for job alerts First Name (required) a8e4a2c2 Last Name (required) 5ad4ae65 Email (required) 85cac463 Job Alert f449a43f Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories L9 $138,698 - $145,268 +17% super Office of the Deputy Vice-Chancellor (Research and Innovation) Professional L9 $138,698 - $145,268 +17% super Office of the 